    "body": "**Problem:** Full chainstate compaction can temporarily require nearly another copy of the database before old files are deleted.\n\n**Fix:** Log automatic compaction start and finish at info level and warn beforehand if the chainstate filesystem has less free space than `AssumedChainStateSize()`. Compaction continues after the warning because postponing cleanup would allow obsolete data to accumulate. Also document the temporary disk-space requirement and add a release note.\n\nFixes #36585",
