      ],
      "message": "logging: show automatic chainstate compaction\n\nAutomatic chainstate compaction can use substantial disk space and take minutes, but its start and finish are hidden unless `-debug=coindb` is enabled.\nLog both by default so operators can identify the cause of sudden changes in disk usage.",
