        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 9e0a6bc37b1adbf6f8bc86e6af0da61f24ddc46d\nparent 19b1126d5d3848a2706d52a566de977b162a5e90\nauthor Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1792530172 +0200\ncommitter Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1792531452 +0200\n\ncoins: warn of low disk space before compaction\n\nFull chainstate compaction can temporarily write nearly another copy of the database before deleting its input tables.\nWarn before starting if the chainstate filesystem has less free space than the chain's `AssumedChainStateSize()`.\nContinue compaction after the warning because postponing cleanup would let obsolete data accumulate.\n",
